# gcovr / lcov exclusion patterns for yuleASR coverage measurement
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ISO 26262-6 §9.2: coverage measurement shall exclude code that
# cannot be exercised by software-level tests (HW register access,
# ISR entry points, static configuration tables, third-party backends).
#
# These patterns are consumed by:
#   - tools/run_branch_coverage.sh  (lcov --remove)
#   - tools/coverage-ci-wrapper.sh  (lcov --remove)
#   - tools/rebuild_coverage.sh     (gcovr --exclude)
#
# Approved by: Safety Manager
# Date: 2026-10-11
# Expiry: 2027-12-31

